{"created": "2025-02-17T12:41:11.755217+00:00", "modified": "2025-02-17T12:41:11.920912+00:00", "id": 14859952, "conceptrecid": "14859951", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14859952", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.14859951", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14859952", "metadata": {"title": "Data underlying the publication: Assessment of automated stratigraphic interpretations of boreholes with geology-informed metrics", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14859952", "publication_date": "2025-02-17", "description": "<p><span>This repository contains borehole descriptions from the Roer Valley Graben (RVG) maintained by TNO&mdash;Geological Survey of The Netherlands (TNO-GDN), which </span><span>were used</span><span> for the publication \"Assessment of automated stratigraphic interpretations of boreholes with geology-informed metrics.\" <strong>Refer to&nbsp;<a href=\"https://outlook.office.com/mail/(https://www.dinoloket.nl/en/subsurface-data)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DINOloket</a>, the official platform of the TNO-Geological Survey of the Netherlands, to access the latest version of borehole descriptions and interpretations. Information in this dataset might differ from the latest descriptions.</strong></span></p>\n<p><span>The dataset includes lithological descriptions and expert lithostratigraphic interpretations used in the BRO Digital Geological Model v2.2 (TNO-GDN), BRO GeoTOP v1.6 (TNO-GDN), H30-Roerdalslenk (TNO-GDN, VITO &amp; &amp; Geological Survey of Belgium of the Royal Belgian Institute of Natural Sciences) and H30-De Kempen (TNO-GDN, VITO &amp; &amp; Geological Survey of Belgium of the Royal Belgian Institute of Natural Sciences).</span></p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Garz\u00f3n Alvarado, Juan Sebasti\u00e1n", "affiliation": "Utrecht University", "orcid": "0000-0002-8335-9312"}, {"name": "Dakebaussen, Willem", "affiliation": "TNO Geological Survey of the Netherlands"}, {"name": "De Boever, Eva", "affiliation": "TNO Geological Surv